            <ArticleTitle>Urachal cyst, a rare cyst with multiple complications.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>237-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1100/tsw.2008.45</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Urachal cysts are rare, can be one of the forgotten causes of abdominal pain, and can present as adenocarcinoma of the bladder, along with many other presentations. There is a real need for physicians, general surgeons, and urologists to be acquainted with the different presentations and management of this rare condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
